# Edge of the length rules (#724): a method F(P:int), with a parameter, in a
# class of 976 characters (977 together, within the 987 measured for methods
# without parameters). Epic refuses Function(Param:int) there (3655,
# followup-book2/long-ident-mangled) and admits Function()
# (followup-book3/long-ident-mangled-no-params). OpenVerse admits it and
# prints
#   method 7
# If Epic refuses it, a parameter alone takes the method past the limit. Run
# it alone (single mode).
Class2__ := class:
    V:int = 42
    F(P:int):int = P

Main():void =
    Print("OVPROBE method {Class2__{}.F(7)}")
